          "snippet": {
            "line": 259,
            "text": "noncomputable def radialDivergence (k : ℝ) (S : SimilarityProfile.PhysicalProfile)\n    (p : SimilarityProfile.PhysicalPoint) : ℝ :=\n  Real.sqrt (2 * p.2.1) * SimilarityProfile.partialS S p +\n    k * S p / Real.sqrt (2 * p.2.1)"
